# 两个服务统一使用仓库根目录作为构建上下文。
# 首先忽略所有文件
**

# Codex 仅包含应用源码、共享配置和构建输入。
!codex_bridge/
codex_bridge/**
!codex_bridge/Dockerfile
!codex_bridge/pyproject.toml
!codex_bridge/uv.lock
!codex_bridge/README.md
!codex_bridge/__init__.py
!codex_bridge/main.py
!codex_bridge/configs/
codex_bridge/configs/**
!codex_bridge/configs/*.json
!codex_bridge/configs/*.py
!codex_bridge/codex/
codex_bridge/codex/**
!codex_bridge/codex/*.py
!codex_bridge/middleware/
codex_bridge/middleware/**
!codex_bridge/middleware/*.py
!codex_bridge/session/
codex_bridge/session/**
!codex_bridge/session/*.py
!codex_bridge/services/
codex_bridge/services/**
!codex_bridge/services/*.py
!codex_bridge/services/lark/
codex_bridge/services/lark/**
!codex_bridge/services/lark/*.py
!codex_bridge/utils/
codex_bridge/utils/**
!codex_bridge/utils/*.py
!entrypoint.sh

# MCP 保留整个目录内容
!mcp_service/
!mcp_service/**

# 公共排除规则必须放在白名单之后，避免被重新包含。
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
**/.env
**/.git
**/tests
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/skills-office
**/skills
